            <p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.35;">Dana Reed says they didn't change their sign-in email</p>
            
          </td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:6px 20px 28px;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">Dana Reed pressed &quot;This wasn't me&quot; on a notice about a change to their sign-in email at Rhode Island Association of Local Election Officials. Every session they had has been signed out.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 14px;"><tbody>
    <tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;color:#5e697d;width:110px;vertical-align:top;">Member</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">Dana Reed</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px;color:#5e697d;width:110px;vertical-align:top;">Old address</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">dana.reed@county.gov</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px;color:#5e697d;width:110px;vertical-align:top;">New address</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">dana.reed@newcounty.gov</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px;color:#5e697d;width:110px;vertical-align:top;">Requested by</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">the member</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:12px;color:#5e697d;width:110px;vertical-align:top;">Requested</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:14px;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">June 15, 2026 at 2:41 p.m. UTC</td></tr>
  </tbody></table><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">The change had already taken effect. The new address was their sign-in email.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">FloorVote does not reverse a change that has taken effect, because the old mailbox may now belong to someone else. Reach the member another way, such as by phone, before you act. An admin can change their email back from Members.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:18px;"><a href="https://sample.test/admin/members?search=dana.reed%40county.gov" style="display:inline-block;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;">Open Members</a></div>
          </td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:22px 20px 4px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;text-align:center;">
            Sent to every active owner and admin as an account security alert.<br><a href="https://sample.test" style="font-size:12px;color:#667386;text-decoration:underline;">FloorVote</a>
          </td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </td></tr></tbody>
  </table>
</body>
</html>"
`;

