        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5e697d;word-break:break-word;">550 5.1.10 RESOLVER.ADR.RecipientNotFound; Recipient not found by SMTP address lookup</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;word-break:break-all;">casey.morgan@example.org</p>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5e697d;word-break:break-word;">552 5.2.2 The email account that you tried to reach is over quota</p>
      </td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">Check each address for a typo. On Members, open each member's Actions menu and choose Change email… to send a new invite to the corrected address.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:18px;"><a href="https://sample.test/admin/members" style="display:inline-block;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;">Open Members</a></div>
          </td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:22px 20px 4px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;text-align:center;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#667386;">Sent to the Admin who sent the invite, or to every Owner when that Admin no longer manages members.</p><a href="https://sample.test" style="font-size:12px;color:#667386;text-decoration:underline;">FloorVote</a>
          </td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </td></tr></tbody>
  </table>
</body>
</html>"
`;

